<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ETF-Portfolio-Bericht — {{ valuation_date.isoformat() }}</title>
<script>{{ echarts_js | safe }}</script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f4f5f7;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --ink: #1a1f2b;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --border: #e4e6ea;
    --accent: #2457c5;
    --accent-soft: #e8edfb;
    --pos: #1a8a52;
    --neg: #c23b3b;
    --amber: #b5790a;
    --radius: 14px;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    /* docs/dev/report-v3-concept.md Step F (dark mode) is deferred this pass;
       vars are here so a future pass only has to fill them in. */
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .amt, .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem 4rem; }
  .hidden-amounts .amt { filter: blur(5px); user-select: none; }

  header.band {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 1rem 0 .6rem;
  }
  header.band h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0; }
  header.band .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .dq-dot { display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: .3rem; }
  .dq-dot.green { background: var(--pos); } .dq-dot.amber { background: var(--amber); } .dq-dot.red { background: var(--neg); }
  .toggles button { background: none; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: .35rem .7rem;
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; margin-left: .4rem; }

  nav.jump { position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--bg); z-index: 20; display: flex; gap: 1rem;
    padding: .5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 13px;
    overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
  nav.jump a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  nav.jump a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; }
  .grid-12 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .col-4 { grid-column: span 4; } .col-8 { grid-column: span 8; } .col-6 { grid-column: span 6; } .col-12 { grid-column: span 12; }
  .col-5 { grid-column: span 5; } .col-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .col-4, .col-5, .col-6, .col-7, .col-8 { grid-column: span 12; } }

  section.layer { margin: 2.2rem 0; }
  h2.section-title { font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 .9rem; padding-bottom: .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  h2.section-title .note { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 400; }

  .summary p { margin: 0 0 .6rem; font-size: 14px; }
  .summary p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .8rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .tile .label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .tile .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: .1rem; }
  .tile .sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .1rem; }
  .pos { color: var(--pos); } .neg { color: var(--neg); }

  .health-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .health-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .health-item { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: .6rem .7rem; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .health-item .dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: .35rem; }
  .health-item .dot.green { background: var(--pos); } .health-item .dot.amber { background: var(--amber); }
  .health-item .dot.red { background: var(--neg); } .health-item .dot.na { background: var(--border); }
  .health-item .v { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-top: .15rem; }
  .health-item .d { color: var(--muted); margin-top: .1rem; }

  .kpi-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: .7rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .kpi { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: .6rem .7rem; }
  .kpi .label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .kpi .value { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: .1rem; }
  .kpi .reason { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .1rem; }

  table.full { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  table.full th, table.full td { text-align: left; padding: .4rem .5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); white-space: nowrap; }
  table.full th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 11.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .table-scroll table.full { min-width: 560px; }

  details.appendix summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: .5rem 0; }
  details.appendix .sub { margin: 1.4rem 0; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .badge-ok { color: var(--pos); } .badge-bad { color: var(--neg); }
  .dq-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
  .dq-list li { padding: .3rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .dq-list li.error { color: var(--neg); } .dq-list li.warning { color: var(--amber); }

  .chart { width: 100%; height: 360px; }
  .chart.short { height: 260px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .chart { height: 240px; } }

  .goal-sim .controls label { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .7rem; }
  .goal-sim .controls input[type=range] { width: 100%; }
  .preset-btns { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .3rem; }
  .preset-btns button { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); border: none; border-radius: 8px;
    padding: .3rem .7rem; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .preset-btns button.active { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

  .bar-list .item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr 5.5rem; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; padding: .3rem 0; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bar-list .item .name { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .bar-list .item .bar-track { background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; height: 8px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar-list .item .bar-fill { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: 4px; }
  .bar-list .item .bar-fill.pos { background: var(--pos); left: 50%; } .bar-list .item .bar-fill.neg { background: var(--neg); right: 50%; }
  .bar-list .item .v { text-align: right; font-weight: 600; }

  @media print {
    nav.jump, .toggles, .preset-btns, input[type=range] { display: none !important; }
    details.appendix { display: block; } details.appendix > :not(summary) { display: block !important; }
    .card { box-shadow: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header class="band">
  <div>
    <h1>ETF-Portfolio-Bericht · Stand {{ valuation_date.isoformat() }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">
      Daten bis {{ booking_as_of.isoformat() }} · Kurse vom {{ valuation_date.isoformat() }} ·
      <span class="dq-dot {{ dq_dot_color }}" title="{{ dq_dot_title }}"></span>Datenqualität
      · Quelle {{ source_file }}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="toggles">
    <button id="hide-toggle" type="button">Beträge verbergen</button>
    <button onclick="window.print()" type="button">Drucken</button>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="jump">
  <a href="#ueberblick">Überblick</a>
  <a href="#performance">Performance</a>
  <a href="#beitrag">Beitrag</a>
  <a href="#risiko">Risiko</a>
  <a href="#allokation">Allokation</a>
  <a href="#kosten">Kosten</a>
  <a href="#ziele">Ziele</a>
  <a href="#anhang">Anhang</a>
</nav>

<!-- ============ LAYER 1 — ÜBERBLICK ============ -->
<section class="layer" id="ueberblick">
  <div class="grid-12">
    <div class="col-4 card summary">
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:0">Zusammenfassung</h2>
      {% for s in summary_sentences %}<p>{{ s }}</p>{% endfor %}
      <div class="tiles">
        <div class="tile">
          <div class="label">Depotwert</div>
          <div class="value amt">{{ kpis.value | eur if kpis.value is not none else "n/a" }}{% if kpis.value_estimated %} ≈{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="sub">{% if kpis.value is none %}{{ kpis.value_reason }}{% else %}inkl. Cash{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <div class="label">Gewinn €</div>
          <div class="value amt {{ 'pos' if kpis.gain_eur and kpis.gain_eur > 0 else 'neg' if kpis.gain_eur and kpis.gain_eur < 0 else '' }}">{{ kpis.gain_eur | eur(true) if kpis.gain_eur is not none else "n/a" }}</div>
          <div class="sub">seit Start</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <div class="label">Rendite p.a. (XIRR)</div>
          <div class="value {{ 'pos' if kpis.xirr and kpis.xirr > 0 else 'neg' if kpis.xirr and kpis.xirr < 0 else '' }}">{{ kpis.xirr | pct if kpis.xirr is not none else "n/a" }}</div>
          <div class="sub">eigene Cashflows berücksichtigt</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <div class="label">vs. Benchmark</div>
          {% if kpis.twr is not none and kpis.benchmark_twr is not none %}
          <div class="value {{ 'pos' if kpis.twr > kpis.benchmark_twr else 'neg' }}">{{ ((kpis.twr - kpis.benchmark_twr) * 100) | de_num(1, true) }} pp</div>
          <div class="sub">TWR, gleicher Zeitraum{% if kpis.coverage_estimated %} · ≈{% endif %}</div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="value">n/a</div><div class="sub">keine Kursabdeckung</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-8 card">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin:0;border:none;padding:0">Wertentwicklung</h2>
        <div>
          <span class="preset-btns" id="hero-mode">
            <button data-mode="eur" class="active">€ Vermögen</button>
            <button data-mode="index">Index = 100</button>
            <button data-mode="dd">Drawdown</button>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:.4rem 0">
        <span class="preset-btns" id="hero-range">
          <button data-range="90">3M</button>
          <button data-range="365">1J</button>
          <button data-range="ytd">YTD</button>
          <button data-range="max" class="active">MAX</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div id="chart-hero" class="chart"></div>
      <div class="note" style="margin-top:.4rem">
        {% if kpis.twr_start %}Performance-Linie seit {{ kpis.twr_start.isoformat() }}{% if kpis.coverage_estimated %} · ≈ geschätzt ({{ (kpis.coverage_implied_share * 100) | round(0) | int }} % implizite Kurse aus Kaufpreisen){% endif %}{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="health-strip">
    {% for h in health_checks %}
    <div class="health-item">
      <div><span class="dot {{ h.status }}"></span>{{ h.label }}</div>
      <div class="v">{{ h.value_text }}</div>
      <div class="d">{{ h.detail }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ LAYER 2 — ANALYSE ============ -->
<section class="layer" id="performance">
  <h2 class="section-title">Performance</h2>
  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">TWR seit Start</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.twr | pct if kpis.twr is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">TWR p.a.</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.twr_pa | pct if kpis.twr_pa is not none else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.twr_pa is none %}<div class="reason">Abdeckung &lt; 1 Jahr</div>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">TWR YTD</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.twr_ytd | pct if kpis.twr_ytd is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Rolling 1 Jahr</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.rolling_1y | pct if kpis.rolling_1y is not none else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.rolling_1y is none %}<div class="reason">Abdeckung &lt; 1 Jahr</div>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Bester Monat</div><div class="value pos">{{ kpis.best_month.ret | pct if kpis.best_month else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.best_month %}<div class="reason">{{ kpis.best_month.month }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Schlechtester Monat</div><div class="value neg">{{ kpis.worst_month.ret | pct if kpis.worst_month else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.worst_month %}<div class="reason">{{ kpis.worst_month.month }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-12">
    <div class="col-8 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Monatsrenditen — Portfolio vs. Benchmark</h3>
      <div id="chart-heatmap" class="chart short"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-4 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Jahresrenditen</h3>
      <div id="chart-annual" class="chart short"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="layer" id="beitrag">
  <h2 class="section-title">Beitrag <span class="note">— woher kommt Ihr Geld</span></h2>
  <div class="grid-12">
    <div class="col-6 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Ergebnis je Instrument (realisiert + unrealisiert)</h3>
      <div id="chart-contribution" class="chart short"></div>
      <div class="note">Erträge (Dividenden) werden im Ledger nur monatlich, nicht je Instrument verbucht, und sind hier deshalb nicht enthalten — siehe Wasserfall rechts für die Gesamtsicht.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-6 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Wasserfall: Einzahlungen → Depotwert</h3>
      {% if waterfall %}
      <div id="chart-waterfall" class="chart short"></div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="note">n/a — Depotwert nicht vollständig bewertet ({{ kpis.value_reason }}).</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="layer" id="risiko">
  <h2 class="section-title">Risiko</h2>
  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Volatilität p.a.</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.volatility | pct if kpis.volatility is not none else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.volatility is none %}<div class="reason">&lt; 120 Tageswerte</div>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Max Drawdown</div><div class="value neg">{{ kpis.max_drawdown | pct if kpis.max_drawdown is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Akt. Drawdown</div><div class="value {{ 'neg' if kpis.current_drawdown and kpis.current_drawdown < 0 }}">{{ kpis.current_drawdown | pct if kpis.current_drawdown is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">DD-Dauer (max / aktuell)</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.drawdown_duration_max_days ~ " / " ~ kpis.drawdown_duration_current_days ~ " T." if kpis.drawdown_duration_max_days is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Sharpe</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.sharpe | de_num(2) }}</div><div class="reason">r_f {{ kpis.risk_free_rate | pct }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Sortino</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.sortino | de_num(2) }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Beta / Korrelation</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.beta | de_num(2) }} / {{ kpis.correlation | de_num(2) }}</div><div class="reason">vs. Benchmark</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Underwater — Abstand zum bisherigen Hoch</h3>
    <div id="chart-underwater" class="chart short"></div>
    <p class="note">Risiko/Rendite-Scatter gegen Modell-Portfolios ist in dieser Version nicht enthalten (siehe docs/dev/report-v3-concept.md §5.1/Step D).</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="layer" id="allokation">
  <h2 class="section-title">Allokation &amp; Diversifikation</h2>
  <div class="grid-12">
    <div class="col-6 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Nach Position</h3>
      <div id="chart-alloc-position" class="chart short"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-6 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Nach Anlageklasse</h3>
      <div id="chart-alloc-class" class="chart short"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-12" style="margin-top:1rem">
    <div class="col-4 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Regionen (Look-Through)</h3>
      {% if region_lt.available %}<div id="chart-region" class="chart short"></div>{% else %}<p class="note">n/a — Stammdaten fehlen.<br>{{ region_lt.reason }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="col-4 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Sektoren (Look-Through)</h3>
      {% if sector_lt.available %}<div id="chart-sector" class="chart short"></div>{% else %}<p class="note">n/a — Stammdaten fehlen.<br>{{ sector_lt.reason }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="col-4 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Währungen (Look-Through)</h3>
      {% if currency_lt.available %}<div id="chart-currency" class="chart short"></div>{% else %}<p class="note">n/a — Stammdaten fehlen.<br>{{ currency_lt.reason }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">ETF-Overlap</h3>
    {% if overlap_pairs %}
      <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full"><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>Überlappung (Top-Holdings)</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {% for p in overlap_pairs %}<tr><td>{{ chart_data.holdings_names.get(p.a, p.a) }}</td><td>{{ chart_data.holdings_names.get(p.b, p.b) }}</td><td>{{ p.overlap | pct }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="note">n/a — Stammdaten fehlen. {{ overlap_reason }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="layer" id="kosten">
  <h2 class="section-title">Kosten &amp; Aktivität</h2>
  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Gewichtete TER</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.weighted_ter | pct(2) if kpis.weighted_ter is not none else "n/a" }}</div>{% if kpis.weighted_ter is none %}<div class="reason">{{ kpis.ter_reason }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">TER € / Jahr</div><div class="value amt">{{ kpis.weighted_ter_eur | eur if kpis.weighted_ter_eur is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Steuern netto</div><div class="value amt">{{ kpis.taxes | eur(true) }}</div><div class="reason">+ = Erstattung (Tax Drag)</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Dividenden</div><div class="value amt">{{ kpis.dividends | eur }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Umschlag (12M)</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.turnover_12m | pct(0) if kpis.turnover_12m is not none else "n/a" }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Instrumente</div><div class="value">{{ kpis.instruments_held }} <span class="note">/ {{ kpis.instruments_ever }} gesamt</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">
    {% if kpis.weighted_ter_eur is not none %}Die laufenden Fondskosten betragen ca. {{ kpis.weighted_ter_eur | eur }}/Jahr.{% endif %}
    Explizite Kosten (Order-/Krypto-Gebühren) sind, sofern im CSV als eigene Buchung erkennbar, in der Datenqualität/im Anhang aufgeführt, nicht separat aggregiert.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="layer" id="ziele">
  <h2 class="section-title">Ziele <span class="note">— illustrativ, konstante Rendite, keine Prognose</span></h2>
  <div class="grid-12">
    <div class="col-5 card goal-sim">
      <div class="controls">
        <label>Monatliche Sparrate: € <span id="g-saving-out"></span></label>
        <input type="range" id="g-saving" min="0" max="3000" step="50" value="{{ goal.monthly_saving | default(700) }}">
        <label>Jahre: <span id="g-years-out"></span></label>
        <input type="range" id="g-years" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="{{ goal.years | default(10) }}">
        <label>Rendite p.a.: <span id="g-return-out"></span></label>
        <input type="range" id="g-return" min="0" max="15" step="0.5" value="7">
        <div class="preset-btns" id="g-return-presets">
          <button data-v="4" type="button">4 %</button>
          <button data-v="7" type="button" class="active">7 %</button>
          <button data-v="10" type="button">10 %</button>
        </div>
        <label>Inflation: <span id="g-inflation-out"></span></label>
        <input type="range" id="g-inflation" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="{{ (goal.inflation | default(0.02) * 100) }}">
        <label>Entnahmejahre: <span id="g-wyears-out"></span></label>
        <input type="range" id="g-wyears" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="20">
      </div>
      <div class="tiles" style="margin-top:1rem">
        <div class="tile"><div class="label">Startwert</div><div class="value amt">{{ kpis.value | eur if kpis.value is not none else "0,00 €" }}</div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="label">Zukunftswert (nominal)</div><div class="value" id="g-fv-nominal">—</div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="label">Zukunftswert (real)</div><div class="value" id="g-fv-real">—</div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="label">Monatl. Entnahme</div><div class="value" id="g-withdrawal">—</div></div>
      </div>
      {% if goal.target_wealth_10y %}<p class="note" id="g-progress"></p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="col-7 card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Projektion (Fächer)</h3>
      <div id="chart-fan" class="chart short"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ LAYER 3 — ANHANG (collapsed) ============ -->
<section class="layer" id="anhang">
<details class="appendix">
<summary>Anhang — Positionen, Transaktionen, Abgleich, Datenqualität, Methodik ({{ event_count }} Buchungen)</summary>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Positionen</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full">
    <thead><tr><th>ISIN</th><th>Name</th><th>Menge</th><th>Ø Kosten</th><th>Kurs</th><th>Wert</th><th>Gewicht</th><th>Unrealisiert</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for h in holdings %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ h.isin }}</td><td>{{ h.name }}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ h.qty | qty }}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ h.avg_cost | eur if h.avg_cost is not none else "n/a" }}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ h.price | eur if h.price is not none else "n/a" }}{% if h.estimated %} <span class="note" title="Aus Kaufpreisen abgeleitet">≈</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ h.value | eur if h.value is not none else "n/a" }}</td>
        <td>{{ (h.weight | pct) if h.weight is not none else "n/a" }}</td>
        <td class="amt {{ 'pos' if h.unrealized and h.unrealized > 0 else 'neg' if h.unrealized and h.unrealized < 0 else '' }}">{{ h.unrealized | eur(true) if h.unrealized is not none else "n/a" }}{% if h.unrealized_pct is not none %} ({{ h.unrealized_pct | pct }}){% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
    {% else %}<tr><td colspan="8">Keine offenen Positionen.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Meine Trades</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full">
    <thead><tr><th>Zeitraum</th><th>Käufe</th><th>Verkäufe</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{% for b in trade_buckets %}<tr><td>{{ b.label }}</td><td class="amt pos">{{ b.buy }}</td><td class="amt neg">{{ b.sell }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
  </table></div>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Realisiert je Instrument</h3>
  <div class="bar-list" id="realized-bars"></div>

  <details style="margin-top:1rem">
    <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;padding:.4rem 0">Verkaufsliste ({{ sells | length }})</summary>
    <input type="text" id="sell-filter" placeholder="Nach ISIN oder Name filtern…" style="width:100%;margin:.6rem 0;padding:.5rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:.85rem">
    <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full" id="sell-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Datum</th><th>Name</th><th>Menge</th><th>Erlös</th><th>Kosten</th><th>Gewinn</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for s in sells %}
        <tr data-search="{{ (s.name or s.isin) | lower }} {{ s.isin | lower }}">
          <td>{{ s.date.isoformat() }}</td><td>{{ s.name or s.isin }}</td>
          <td class="amt">{{ s.qty | qty }}</td><td class="amt">{{ s.proceeds | eur }}</td><td class="amt">{{ s.cost | eur }}</td>
          <td class="amt {{ 'pos' if s.gain > 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ s.gain | eur(true) }}</td>
        </tr>
      {% else %}<tr><td colspan="6">Keine Verkäufe.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </details>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Abgleich — Vorabpauschale-Prüfpunkte</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full">
    <thead><tr><th>ISIN</th><th>Name</th><th>Stichtag</th><th>Gemeldete Menge</th><th>Rekonstruierte Menge</th><th>Abgleich</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for v in vap_checks %}
      <tr><td>{{ v.isin }}</td><td>{{ v.name }}</td><td>{{ v.checkpoint.isoformat() }}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ v.stated_qty | qty }}</td><td class="amt">{{ v.reconstructed_qty | qty }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'badge-ok' if v.ok else 'badge-bad' }}">{{ "✓" if v.ok else "✗ Diff " + (v.diff | qty) }}</td></tr>
    {% else %}<tr><td colspan="6">Keine Vorabpauschale-Prüfpunkte in diesem Export.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Kursabdeckung je ISIN</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table class="full">
    <thead><tr><th>ISIN</th><th>Name</th><th>Status</th><th>Von</th><th>Bis</th><th>Markttage</th><th>Implizite Tage</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for p in price_coverage %}
      <tr><td>{{ p.isin }}</td><td>{{ p.name }}</td><td>{{ p.status }}</td>
        <td>{{ p['from'].isoformat() if p['from'] else "—" }}</td><td>{{ p.to.isoformat() if p.to else "—" }}</td>
        <td class="amt">{{ p.market_days }}</td><td class="amt">{{ p.implied_days }}</td></tr>
    {% else %}<tr><td colspan="7">Keine Kurse geladen.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Datenqualität <span class="note">({{ event_count }} Buchungen, {{ unknown_count }} unbekannt, {{ buy_count }} Käufe, {{ sell_count }} Verkäufe, Cash Σ {{ cash_sum | eur }})</span></h3>
  <ul class="dq-list">
  {% for item in dq_items %}<li class="{{ item.severity }}">{{ item.message }}</li>
  {% else %}<li>Keine Datenqualitätsprobleme gefunden.</li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="sub">
  <h3>Methodik &amp; Konventionen</h3>
  <ul class="note" style="padding-left:1.1rem">
    <li>TWR/Drawdown/Risiko-Kennzahlen starten erst am Tag, ab dem jede damals gehaltene Position einen Kurs hat (siehe Kursabdeckung) — nicht am ersten Einzahlungstag.</li>
    <li>Ein Kurs ist entweder vollständig Markt- oder vollständig aus Kaufpreisen abgeleitet pro Haltezeitraum, nie gemischt innerhalb eines Zeitraums (docs/dev/report-v3-concept.md §1).</li>
    <li>XIRR nutzt den Depotwert zum Stichtag als Schlusszahlung; ohne vollständige Bewertung ist XIRR n/a.</li>
    <li>Sharpe/Sortino nutzen einen festen Zinssatz ({{ kpis.risk_free_rate | pct }}) aus config.yaml, keine Live-Daten.</li>
    <li>Risiko/Rendite-Scatter, Modell-Portfolios und Marktumfeld/News (docs §5) sind in dieser Version nicht enthalten.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

</details>
</section>

</div>{# /wrap #}

<script id="report-data" type="application/json">{{ data_json | safe }}</script>
<script>
{% include "static/_charts.js" %}
</script>
</body>
</html>
